[I] Ocaml bindings to the Augeas configuration editing tool

[T] ocaml-augeas provides OCaml bindings to Augeas, the library and tool for
[T] programmatically editing configuration files through a tree
[T] representation. It is used by OCaml programs such as virt-v2v and
[T] libguestfs tools.

[U] https://augeas.net/

[A] David Lutterkort
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
[F] CROSS NO-LTO.gcc NOPARALLEL

[L] LGPL
[V] 0.7
[P] X -----5---9 500.010

[D] e46cf5a9d60f1d31b92c60784bdc78ed99238a17647eaeb7c7c2ae4c ocaml-augeas-0.7.tar.gz https://download.libguestfs.org/ocaml-augeas/

var_append CC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -std=gnu17

# ocamlfind refuses to overwrite a previous install of the package
hook_add inmake 5 "ocamlfind remove -destdir $root$libdir/site-lib augeas"
